  <wpt lat="46.326332" lon="7.722936">
    <name>Jeizinen / Gampel (Valais) [small cable car]</name>
    <desc>Jeizinen 1526 m - top of the Gampel cable car

Trails
Two marked local routes that see almost no traffic: Jeizibarg Bike (117) and Jeizi Enduro (118), dropping through the dry south-facing slopes above the Rhone. Steep, loose, natural. The Pfyn-Finges nature park right below is worth a detour on the way back.

Getting up / price
Small local cable car (Luftseilbahn Gampel-Jeizinen), runs all year, cheap by Valais standards - price not verified here.

Open season
Open from 1 May; closed from 1 November (typical window; check the operator and conditions).
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

Access
From | Transport | Duration
Lausanne | Train | ~1h55

Source: Gampel-Bratsch tourism. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="46.315529" lon="7.739287">
    <name>Jeizinen: Gampel cable car - valley station</name>
    <desc>Bottom station, a few minutes from Gampel-Steg railway station. Runs all year.</desc>
  </wpt>
