  <wpt lat="46.349500" lon="6.695000">
    <name>Bernex (Haute-Savoie, FR) [Magic Pass]</name>
    <desc>Bernex bike trails - Pré-Richard sector

Trails
A compact set of built trails above the village: La Verte (easiest), Bern'land, Chill Trail, Wood Roots, River Creek and Hors Piste. Mostly forest, mostly flowy, and a genuinely short trip if you take the boat.

Getting up / price
Bernex joins the Magic Pass network for the 2026/27 season. Summer lift operation is not guaranteed every day - verify before travelling, otherwise it is a pedal-up spot.

Open season
Open from 1 July; closed from 1 September (typical window; check the operator and conditions).

Access
From | Transport | Duration
Lausanne | Boat + bus | ~1h30

Source: Bernex tourism. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
