  <wpt lat="46.828967" lon="9.516227">
    <name>Chur - Brambrueesch [from 53 CHF]</name>
    <desc>Brambrueesch 1600 m - top of the Chur cable car

Trails
The valley-floor member of the Bike Kingdom, and the one to pick if the weather up high looks bad. Four built flow trails drop off Brambrueesch back into town: Brambi Flow and Chur Flow are the easy, jumpy ones, Alpen Ride is longer and more natural, and Rock'n'Roll is the rough one. Around 1000 m of descent, straight into a city with trains home.

Getting up / price
Covered by the same Bike Kingdom ticket, from 53 CHF. The cable car starts inside the city, so there is no bus and no transfer at the far end.

Open season
Open from 15 May; closed from 2 November (typical window; check the operator and conditions).
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

Access
From | Transport | Duration
Lausanne | Train | ~3h45

Source: Chur tourism. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
