  <wpt lat="46.589276" lon="7.538733">
    <name>Wiriehorn - Diemtigtal [43 CHF]</name>
    <desc>Wiriehorn - top of the chairlift

Trails
The bike park at the head of the Diemtigtal, in a nature park that most people drive straight past. Three downhill runs covering the full range: Alptrail is the gentle learning line, Old T-Bar the intermediate, and Weryhorny the challenging one. Two pumptracks and a kids' park at the bottom make it a good family base, and the valley itself is one of the quietest in the Oberland.

Getting up / price
Day pass with trail access 43 CHF adult, 38 CHF youth and seniors; children 6-15 pay their age in francs. Long season - April through mid-November, daily in high summer, with Friday and Saturday evening running until 20:00 in July and August.

Open season
Open from 1 April; closed from 16 November (typical window; check the operator and conditions).
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Typical daytime hours; published Friday and Saturday evening service runs until 20:00 in July and August.

Access
From | Transport | Duration
Lausanne | Train + bus | ~2h45

Source: Wiriehorn. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
