  <wpt lat="46.458025" lon="7.650412">
    <name>Kandersteg - Sunnbuel [cable car, price unverified]</name>
    <desc>Sunnbuel 1936 m - top of the cable car

Trails
A marked freeride route rather than a bike park: the descent from Sunnbuel back down to Kandersteg, with an alternative variant lower down. High, rocky and exposed at the top, then a long technical drop through the gorge. Serious terrain in a serious place - the Gemmi and the Bluemlisalp are right there.

Getting up / price
Sunnbuelbahn cable car. Check sunnbuel.ch for bike fare before travelling.

Open season
Open from 15 June; closed from 19 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

Access
From | Transport | Duration
Lausanne | Train | ~2h00

Source: Sunnbuel cable car. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
