  <wpt lat="46.563689" lon="7.897119">
    <name>Murren (Lauterbrunnen) [Jungfrau lifts, price unverified]</name>
    <desc>Murren - car-free village and lift hub

Trails
Murren Bike, SuisseMobile route 450: a high balcony traverse and descent under the Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau, which is as good a backdrop as riding gets. More mountain route than bike park - alp tracks, some singletrack, and a long drop back to the Lauterbrunnen valley floor. Go for the setting rather than the trail features.

Getting up / price
Reached by cable car and mountain railway from Lauterbrunnen - Murren has no road, so everything comes up by lift. Bike carriage is possible but capacity is tight and the 2026 fares are not confirmed here; check jungfrau.ch first.

Open season
Open from 15 June; closed from 19 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).
Daily opening hours: 06:00-23:30
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

Access
From | Transport | Duration
Lausanne | Train | ~3h00

Source: Murren tourism. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
