  <wpt lat="46.441362" lon="8.166794">
    <name>Bellwald (Goms, above Fiesch) [gondola, price unverified]</name>
    <desc>Richinen 2000 m - top of the Bellwald gondola

Trails
The surprise of the upper Valais: a small village with five properly built trails off one lift, and almost nobody on them. Flowtrail Forest Bump and Sliderman are the flowing ones, Into the Wild and Vast &amp; Furious get rougher, and Downhill Dirty Cranking is what the name suggests. South facing, so it dries fast and rides well into October. Bellwald and the wider Aletsch Arena return as a UCI Enduro World Cup venue in 2026 after hosting the 2025 World Championships enduro races.

Getting up / price
Small local gondola to Richinen. Bike carriage is offered; check bellwald.ch for fare before travelling.

Open season
Open from 15 June; closed from 19 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

Access
From | Transport | Duration
Lausanne | Train + bus | ~2h45

Sources: Bellwald and 2026 UCI calendar. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
