  <wpt lat="44.207730" lon="6.928080">
    <name>Auron (Saint-Etienne-de-Tinee) [20 EUR]</name>
    <desc>Blainon 2105 m - top of the Blainon chairlift

Trails
The Tinee valley's gravity centre, and the easiest of the Nice parks to get a full day out of: marked descents drop nearly 500 m off Blainon straight back into the village, with a second, gentler sector above the Pinatelle gondola and the Lieuson chairlift. Grassy and fast up high, forested and rooty lower down. Auron is a Maxiavalanche venue: the downhill-marathon series uses mass start race heats on specially selected courses with roughly 1000-1500 m of descent.

Getting up / price
Bike day pass 20 EUR, half day 15 EUR, single ride 10 EUR. Season pass 130 EUR for Auron alone, or 150 EUR for the Mercantour pass that also covers Isola 2000. Lifts run 4 July to 30 August 2026; the Las Donnas cable car is out for maintenance. A Cimes du Mercantour card (1.50 EUR) is needed on top of the pass.

Open season
Open from 4 July; closed from 31 August (published 2026 dates).
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

Access
From | Transport | Duration
Nice | Car | ~2h00

Sources: Auron and Maxiavalanche Auron. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="44.219900" lon="6.929730">
    <name>Auron: Blainon chairlift base (village, 1615 m)</name>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="44.074860" lon="6.941120">
    <name>Valberg (Alpes-Maritimes) [16 EUR]</name>
    <desc>Eguilles 1875 m - top of the Eguilles chairlift

Trails
Seven downhill runs in the Garibeuil sector, all fed by one chairlift and all finishing back at the bottom station, so laps are quick. About 400 m of descent each. The black line traced by world champion Loic Bruni holds the technical sections; the rest is flowing and well within reach of an intermediate.

Getting up / price
The Eguilles chairlift takes riders and bikes up in about 8 minutes. Bike day pass 16 EUR for adults, 14 EUR under 16. Pre-opening weekends from 13 June, then daily 27 June to 30 August 2026.

Open season
Open from 27 June; closed from 31 August (published 2026 dates).
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.

Access
