    <name>Bikepark Leogang - Asitz (Salzburg) [66 EUR]</name>
    <desc>Asitz 1755 m - top of the Asitzbahn

Trails
The World Cup hill, and the one most riders mean when they say Austria. Hangman II is the race track, steep and rooty into the finish arena; Riderman and Speedster are the long, jump-heavy signature lines; the Flying Gangster and the wood-built sections keep it from being just another mountainside. There is a genuine green progression line and a skills area at the bottom, so it is not only a park for people who already send.

Getting up / price
The Asitzbahn gondola runs in two sections from Leogang at 835 m, with the Asitzgipfelbahn continuing to 1860 m. Day pass 66 EUR adult in main season, 56 EUR for four hours; prices are dynamic and cheaper booked online. Season pass 449 EUR, and it also covers Saalbach Hinterglemm, Fieberbrunn and the Kitzsteinhorn. Open 8 May to 8 November 2026.

Open season
Open from 8 May; closed from 9 November (published 2026 dates).
Daily opening hours: 08:30-16:30
