    <name>Flims Laax Falera - Crap Sogn Gion (Graubunden) [from 49 CHF]</name>
    <desc>Crap Sogn Gion 2215 m - top of the LAAX cable car

Trails
One of the best-built trail networks in Switzerland, and the home of the Runca Trail: 7.6 km and 740 m of descent of flow, widely rated the finest flow line in the country. The Never End Trail adds a long natural descent back towards Flims, and the mini pipe and freestyle area at Crap Sogn Gion are the summer half of the resort's park-and-pipe reputation.

Getting up / price
The LAAX cable car and the Arena Express from Flims both carry bikes to Crap Sogn Gion. Bike day passes start around 49 CHF for an adult; rates vary by date, so book online.

