Trails
The quiet one. Ten marked mountain-bike routes fan out from Motta Naluns, two easy, two intermediate, three advanced and three hard, and they are natural trails cut into the hillside rather than shaped berms. 850 m of descent back to Scuol, and the Unterengadin gets a lot more sun and a lot fewer riders than Graubunden's headline parks. Finish in the Scuol thermal baths.

Getting up / price
The Scuol gondola carries bikes, as do the Ftan and Naluns chairlifts. The operator publishes its summer tariff on bergbahnen-scuol.ch; we could not confirm a 2026 bike day rate, so check before you go.

