Trails
The Jochpass Trail is the reason to come: 4.5 km of flowtrail from the pass down to Trubsee, gentle curves and small jumps, with no technical difficulty and a genuinely spectacular setting under the Titlis. Lower down, the Hells-Bells Trail adds 1.6 km with berms and a few harder sections. Not a big park, but a very good day, and easy to reach from Lucerne without a car.

Getting up / price
The Titlis Xpress gondola from Engelberg at 1000 m to Trubsee, then the Jochpass chairlift. MTB day pass 42 CHF for 16 and over, 21 CHF for 6 to 15, valid Engelberg - Trubsee - Jochpass - Engstlenalp.

