13 km of easy and intermediate BikerTrails above the Walensee, which makes this the friendliest gravity day within an hour of Zurich. BlueSalamander drops from Prodalp, and Red Fox and Red Rock come off the Prodkamm chairlift higher up. Nothing here is trying to frighten you; it is a place to build confidence with a lake view.

