The Grand Massif Express climbs almost 900 m out of the valley floor, which gives Samoens some of the longest continuous descents in Haute-Savoie. The bike park itself is moderate rather than extreme, but the pass covers Flaine, Les Carroz and Morillon too, so an enduro day linking four resorts is the real draw.

