    <desc>Bouleaux chairlift summit 2215 m - maintained riding above Pla d'Adet

Trails
More than 40 km of marked green-to-black trails between 2215 m and 1700 m. Family Rider and Easy Rider provide genuine progression terrain, while Woodstock brings long flow and wood features; K-Bourre and Razorback supply the technical black riding. Ten maintained trails and an initiation zone make this one of the most complete parks in the French Pyrenees.

Getting up / price
The detachable Bouleaux chairlift carries bikes. The 2026 adult day pass is 22.50 EUR from Pla d'Adet or 26 EUR including the cable car from Saint-Lary village.

Open season
Open from 27 June; closed from 31 August (published 2026 dates). The opening weekend uses the Bouleaux chairlift only; daily operation runs from 4 July through 30 August.
