Trails
Thirteen downhill circuits and more than 45 km of riding split between La Tosa and Comella, with freeride features, a woodpark, e-bike routes and a children's zone. The range runs from progression tracks to the 2.3 km Comella DH race course, which loses more than 400 m through technical natural and shaped sections.

Getting up / price
The Cadi-Moixero gondola and Cap de Comella chairlift serve the park. The latest verified adult day rate is 31 EUR including insurance; check the resort for the current 2026 rate and lift schedule.

