    <name>Stuttgart Cerro Abajo (Germany) [urban DH event course]</name>
    <desc>2026 Red Bull Cerro Abajo World Series final

Event
Stuttgart hosts the series final on 5-6 September 2026. The event brings elite urban downhill through a temporary course of steep streets, stairs, tight passages, drops and constructed obstacles; final course details may still change before race weekend.

Getting up / price
No bike uplift and no permanent public race trail. Follow the organizer for spectator zones and event access.

&amp;#9888;&amp;#65039; This pin documents an announced professional event, not a trail to ride. Do not enter construction or race areas outside authorized access.
