  <wpt lat="32.735000" lon="-16.959500">
    <name>Trans Madeira (Portugal) [six-day enduro, shuttle event]</name>
    <desc>Island-crossing stage race through Madeira and Porto Santo

Trails
Trans Madeira links high volcanic ridges, laurel forest, exposed rock, loam and coastal finishes across six long days. It is a race-led way to experience an unusually diverse island network, with 6-8 hours on the bike per day and some stages using trails opened under special event permits. The 2026 editions run 18-23 May and 28 September-3 October.

Getting up / price
Event shuttles and logistics are included for registered riders; there is no public lift system. The published event package is 2250 EUR. Outside the race, use a licensed local guide or shuttle and verify land access because the race route is not a permanent signed trail.

