    <desc>America's dedicated lift-served gravity mountain

Trails
Opened as the world's first lift-accessed mountain dedicated entirely to biking, Highland is renowned for progressive downhill, huge jump lines, dirt jumps, skills zones and a world-class slopestyle course. Green learning terrain and coaching sit alongside race tracks and expert freeride lines such as NE Style and the Claymore competition terrain.

Getting up / price
The chairlift and Central Park surface lift serve the park. Published 2026 adult walk-up day passes are 68 USD midweek and 82 USD on weekends or holidays; season passes are also offered.

Open season
Open from 23 April; closed from 16 November (published 2026 dates).
Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00
Core hours shown; Fridays run later in spring and summer, operating days reduce outside peak season, and late fall closes at 16:00. Check the detailed calendar.

